id=aod_wander_compat
name=AOD Wander Compat
version=1.0
versionCode=1
author=cLangsdorff & Claude
description=Patches AODService DN.smali to eliminate oversized burn-in protection wandering ranges on LCD. On OLED the screen blacks out during the AOD transition hiding element movement; on LCD the screen stays on so large ranges cause visible sliding. Forces the small-range paths for PortClock, PortBattery, PortBottom and zeroes the PortNowBar range.
